{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S03\",\"screen\":\"歌声渐渐退到后面，水波般的摇曳托着身体，沉默也很舒服，心却慢慢漂远。\",\"source\":\"也可以想成亲密交谈后忽然安静下来：沉默并不尴尬，反而很舒服；身体还在这里，心却已经慢慢漂远。\",\"type\":\"6\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"原文是提供一种听感想象，屏幕稿将其并入人物叙述，变成他当下真实的心理状态。\"},{\"sec\":\"S10\",\"screen\":\"紧绷的肩膀终于松开，胸腔打开\",\"source\":\"像一直微微绷着肩膀的人，终于长长呼出一口气，胸腔一下打开。\",\"type\":\"6\",\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"原文是用身体姿态比喻音乐带来的放松感，屏幕稿去掉比喻标记并并入人物叙述，变成了人物实际的身体反应。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "eb1c74e3-e6dc-4011-a116-bbadae81ca97", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261108T213606556637Z", "elapsed_seconds": 367.781, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T21:42:14.340599+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "67f78a23593b94a73924506a9b7a2cb69ad0c99619698cedf54ad744c2b51e60", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachme